<title>FRANCE: Valeo expects to announce Brazil project.</title>
<headline>Valeo expects to announce Brazil project.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Car parts manufacturer Valeo said on Tuesday it expected to announce a project later this year or early in 1997 to set up a production plant in Brazil.</p>
<p>Chairman Noel Goutard told Reuters that the company has already a dozen plants in Latin America. He declined to describe the activity of the new Brazilian plant.</p>
<p>He also said that the group expected to continue its push eastward in Europe from Poland and the Czech Republic to Russia as it accompanies its car company clients.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
